    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-6 leading-tight">Does your website work for industrial buyers? A 12-point checklist</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Engineers, contractors and purchasing managers visit your site to check a spec, download a sheet or request a quote. Use this checklist to see whether they can do it in under a minute.</p>
  </div>
